e as one ground in two, a new chat, and the settings at the foot of the rows","parents":[{"sha":"7fb2684ce2404be0fdb8bbfca16b8b2f1855d02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/7fb2684ce2404be0fdb8bbfca16b8b2f1855d02d","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/commit/7fb2684ce2404be0fdb8bbfca16b8b2f1855d02d"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"8fc9caa1e34ee8f3f0744494948e8c0b859eb8d0","node_id":"C_kwDOVh5n29oAKDhmYzljYWExZTM0ZWU4ZjNmMDc0NDQ5NDk0OGU4YzBiODU5ZWI4ZDA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/8fc9caa1e34ee8f3f0744494948e8c0b859eb8d0","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/commit/8fc9caa1e34ee8f3f0744494948e8c0b859eb8d0","author":{"name":"MaurerAnton","email":"MaurerAnton@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-07T13:33:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"MaurerAnton","email":"MaurerAnton@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-07T13:33:23Z"},"tree":{"sha":"96b292bbbb23cce549c1ef12d441bc4254d7e092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/trees/96b292bbbb23cce549c1ef12d441bc4254d7e092"},"message":"Add a press in the settings that asks for one test notification\n\nA Notifications group holds one row: pressed, it asks the machine this\nprogram runs on for a notification of the program's own, which on a phone\nis posted through JNI -- NotificationManager, a channel of this program's\n(Android 8 and later show nothing without one), the right to post asked\nfor once where Android 13 asks for it, and a press on it bringing the\nprogram up. Everywhere else nothing is posted, which is what asking is\nanswered with.\n\nNothing behind it keeps anything: a chat's notifications are not written\nyet, and whether this one was shown is told to nothing either.","parents":[{"sha":"cae7c0784b0f18a359628f33fe15e0dfad868469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/cae7c0784b0f18a359628f33fe15e0dfad868469","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/commit/cae7c0784b0f18a359628f33fe15e0dfad868469"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"6b30157e152113d6715c6db37ce7a3e9da015377","node_id":"C_kwDOVh5n29oAKDZiMzAxNTdlMTUyMTEzZDY3MTVjNmRiMzdjZTdhM2U5ZGEwMTUzNzc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/6b30157e152113d6715c6db37ce7a3e9da015377","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/commit/6b30157e152113d6715c6db37ce7a3e9da015377","author":{"name":"MaurerAnton","email":"MaurerAnton@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-07T15:22:33Z"},"committer":{"name":"MaurerAnton","email":"MaurerAnton@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-07T15:22:33Z"},"tree":{"sha":"9787f6a62f7be3e701d5604e05b4551ee491a7f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/trees/9787f6a62f7be3e701d5604e05b4551ee491a7f0"},"message":"round what is seen: a plate fills by its own corner radius, not its node's\n\nEvery ground in the program was painted square, whatever radius the node\nholding it was given: nodes::Box fills by the radius of the box it is\nitself (skiff src/nodes/box.cc, drawSelf: p.fillRounded(state.fBounds,\nstate.fCornerRadius, ...)), and nothing a parent is told reaches it. The\nground that is painted per corner is the one the node declares itself\n(skiff src/scene.cc, paintBox: p.fill(roundedBox(state, ...), ...)).\n\nSo:\n\n* ask_box, the pill every round press is made of, says its ground of\n  itself and keeps no plate; how it is rounded where it stands is how it\n  is painted.\n* ask_row in the drawer does the same, and is the only place that can\n  have Tasks rounded above and Remote rounded below: nobody told either\n  anything at all before, because a plate keeps one radius for all four\n  corners.\n* A conversation's row chosen is said by the row's own ground now.\n* The plates that stay plates -- a row of the settings, a row of the\n  seeds, a chip at the foot of an answer, the bar's pill, the answerer's\n  bubble -- are told the radius themselves.\n\nAnd the drawer's own four rows are given the field's ground rather than\nthe chosen row's, which the panel behind them is too close to to be told\napart from.","parents":[{"sha":"8fc9caa1e34ee8f3f0744494948e8c0b859eb8d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/8fc9caa1e34ee8f3f0744494948e8c0b859eb8d0","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/commit/8fc9caa1e34ee8f3f0744494948e8c0b859eb8d0"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"8ffdb7c1e571f6fdd8b4379550b5019b2258a147","node_id":"C_kwDOVh5n29oAKDhmZmRiN2MxZTU3MWY2ZmRkOGI0Mzc5NTUwYjUwMTliMjI1OGExNDc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/8ffdb7c1e571f6fdd8b4379550b5019b2258a147","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/commit/8ffdb7c1e571f6fdd8b4379550b5019b2258a147","author":{"name":"MaurerAnton","email":"MaurerAnton@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-07T15:29:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"MaurerAnton","email":"MaurerAnton@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-07T15:29:45Z"},"tree":{"sha":"be316e071cc9b7740ac3f0b2d4a91e639ba9553d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/trees/be316e071cc9b7740ac3f0b2d4a91e639ba9553d"},"message":"shoot the window with the compiler every other desktop build uses","parents":[{"sha":"6b30157e152113d6715c6db37ce7a3e9da015377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/progressive-chat/progressive-chat/git/commits/6b30157e152113d6715c6db37ce7a3e9da015377","html_url":"https://github.com/progressive-chat/progress